# BMS Detail Project Context

- This repository contains two separate products:
  - `main-website/` plus root `index.html` for the public website
  - `client-files-app/` for the internal client portal
- Prefer working only in the area requested for the current task.
- Do not change unrelated files.
- The client portal uses React and Supabase.
- When working on Supabase flows, surface real errors instead of failing silently.
- Keep edits minimal, safe, and easy to review.
